{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v5.json",
  "description": "Scatter plot: household income vs household expenditure by state 2022",
  "width": "container",
  "height": 380,
  "data": {
    "url": "data/state_snapshot.csv"
  },
  "transform": [
    {
      "filter": "datum.state != 'W.P. Putrajaya'"
    }
  ],
  "layer": [
    {
      "mark": {
        "type": "point",
        "filled": true,
        "opacity": 0.85,
        "stroke": "var(--border)",
        "strokeWidth": 0.5
      },
      "encoding": {
        "size": {
          "field": "birth_rate",
          "type": "quantitative",
          "title": "Birth Rate (per 1,000)",
          "scale": {
            "range": [
              100,
              900
            ]
          },
          "legend": {
            "orient": "right",
            "titleFont": "JetBrains Mono",
            "titleFontSize": 10,
            "labelFont": "JetBrains Mono",
            "labelFontSize": 10
          }
        },
        "color": {
          "field": "income_group",
          "type": "nominal",
          "title": "Income Group",
          "scale": {
            "domain": [
              "Low (<5.5k)",
              "Middle (5.5–8k)",
              "High (>8k)"
            ],
            "range": [
              "var(--purple)",
              "var(--accent)",
              "var(--blue)"
            ]
          },
          "legend": {
            "orient": "right",
            "titleFont": "JetBrains Mono",
            "titleFontSize": 10,
            "labelFont": "JetBrains Mono",
            "labelFontSize": 10
          }
        },
        "tooltip": [
          {
            "field": "state",
            "title": "State"
          },
          {
            "field": "income_mean",
            "title": "Mean Income (RM)",
            "format": ","
          },
          {
            "field": "expenditure_mean",
            "title": "Mean Expenditure (RM)",
            "format": ","
          },
          {
            "field": "birth_rate",
            "title": "Birth Rate",
            "format": ".1f"
          },
          {
            "field": "poverty",
            "title": "Poverty Rate (%)",
            "format": ".1f"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "values": [
          {
            "state": "Kelantan",
            "x": 4885,
            "y": 3505,
            "dx": 0,
            "dy": -20,
            "align": "center"
          },
          {
            "state": "Perak",
            "x": 5779,
            "y": 3903,
            "dx": -14,
            "dy": 10,
            "align": "right"
          },
          {
            "state": "Sabah",
            "x": 6171,
            "y": 3342,
            "dx": -14,
            "dy": -14,
            "align": "right"
          },
          {
            "state": "Terengganu",
            "x": 7248,
            "y": 4796,
            "dx": 16,
            "dy": 0,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "state": "Selangor",
            "x": 12233,
            "y": 6770,
            "dx": -16,
            "dy": 0,
            "align": "right"
          },
          {
            "state": "W.P. Kuala Lumpur",
            "x": 13325,
            "y": 7823,
            "dx": 16,
            "dy": 0,
            "align": "left"
          }
        ]
      },
      "mark": {
        "type": "text",
        "fontSize": 9,
        "font": "JetBrains Mono",
        "color": "var(--muted)",
        "fontWeight": "bold",
        "align": {"expr": "datum.align"},
        "dx": {"expr": "datum.dx"},
        "dy": {"expr": "datum.dy"}
      },
      "encoding": {
        "x": {
          "field": "x",
          "type": "quantitative"
        },
        "y": {
          "field": "y",
          "type": "quantitative"
        },
        "text": {
          "field": "state",
          "type": "nominal"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "mark": {
        "type": "line",
        "color": "var(--border)",
        "strokeDash": [
          4,
          3
        ]
      },
      "transform": [
        {
          "regression": "expenditure_mean",
          "on": "income_mean"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "values": [
          {
            "text": [
              "SOCIOECONOMIC INSIGHT: COST OF LIVING PRESSURE",
              "• Income vs. Spend: A near-linear correlation exists",
              "  between household income and expenditure across Malaysia.",
              "• The Childcare Trap: Developed states (KL, Selangor, Penang)",
              "  have high income, but high expenditure forces dual-income",
              "  households, leaving less time/resources for children.",
              "• Demographic Split: High-income states sit at the top-right",
              "  with smaller bubbles (low birth rates), while rural states",
              "  sit at the bottom-left with larger bubbles (high birth rates)."
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "mark": {
        "type": "text",
        "align": "left",
        "baseline": "top",
        "fontSize": 9,
        "font": "JetBrains Mono",
        "color": "var(--text)",
        "opacity": 0.85,
        "lineHeight": 14
      },
      "encoding": {
        "x": {
          "datum": 4200
        },
        "y": {
          "datum": 9300
        },
        "text": {
          "field": "text",
          "type": "nominal"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "values": [
          {}
        ]
      },
      "mark": {
        "type": "text",
        "align": "right",
        "baseline": "bottom",
        "fontSize": 9.5,
        "font": "JetBrains Mono",
        "fontStyle": "italic",
        "color": "var(--muted)"
      },
      "encoding": {
        "x": {
          "datum": 13800
        },
        "y": {
          "datum": 8200
        },
        "text": {
          "value": "High Income & Expenditure →"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "values": [
          {}
        ]
      },
      "mark": {
        "type": "text",
        "align": "left",
        "baseline": "top",
        "fontSize": 9.5,
        "font": "JetBrains Mono",
        "fontStyle": "italic",
        "color": "var(--muted)"
      },
      "encoding": {
        "x": {
          "datum": 4200
        },
        "y": {
          "datum": 3200
        },
        "text": {
          "value": "← Low Income & Expenditure"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "encoding": {
    "x": {
      "field": "income_mean",
      "type": "quantitative",
      "title": "Mean Household Income (RM/month)",
      "scale": {
        "domain": [
          4000,
          14000
        ]
      },
      "axis": {
        "format": ","
      }
    },
    "y": {
      "field": "expenditure_mean",
      "type": "quantitative",
      "title": "Mean Household Expenditure (RM/month)",
      "scale": {
        "domain": [
          3000,
          9500
        ]
      },
      "axis": {
        "format": ","
      }
    }
  }
}